# Stack (source of truth)

This repo is **TanStack Start**, not NestJS, Next.js, or Supabase.

| Concern | Use |
|---|---|
| Framework | TanStack Start + TanStack Router (file-based `src/routes/`) |
| UI | React 19, Tailwind CSS, Radix / shadcn-style `src/components/ui/` |
| Rich text | TipTap v3 + `@tiptap/markdown` (`src/components/ui/tiptap/`); stores plain markdown |
| Server logic | TanStack `createServerFn` in `src/fn/` |
| Data fetching | TanStack Query via `src/queries/` + `src/hooks/` |
| Database | PostgreSQL + Drizzle ORM (`src/db/`, `src/data-access/`) |
| Auth | Better Auth (`src/utils/auth.ts`, `src/lib/auth-client.ts`) |
| Files | Railway Bucket (S3-compatible) via AWS SDK presigned URLs |

## Do not use here

- NestJS modules, controllers, services, DTOs, guards, or DI
- Supabase client, Auth, or RLS patterns
- Next.js App Router, `getServerSideProps`, or Next API routes
- Stripe / Expo / Firebase unless the task explicitly adds them

If a global Cursor user rule conflicts with this file, **follow this file**.

See `CLAUDE.md` and `docs/architecture.md`.
